  "results": [
    "{"schema":"qingmu.native-director-context.v1","scope":{"projectId":"example-project","episodeId":"example-episode","sceneId":"example-scene","shotId":"example-shot"},"contextSnapshotSha256":"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa","contextSnapshot":{"schema":"jason.qingmu-director-context-snapshot.v1","projectId":"example-project","episodeId":"example-episode","sceneId":"example-scene","shotId":"example-shot","contextSnapshotSha256":"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa","shot":{"id":"example-shot","narrative":"门铃响起，她停在门口。"},"sourceScene":{},"selectedReferences":[],"providerCalls":0,"costAmountCny":"0","businessStateChanged":false,"humanDecisionInferred":false,"formalQcInferred":false,"selectionGranted":false,"readyGranted":false},"authority":{"readOnly":true,"businessStateChanged":false,"humanApprovalGranted":false,"providerCalls":0},"guidance":"Base suggestions on this snapshot. Missing information is unknown, not permission to invent story facts or approve assets. Reread before applying changes."}",
    "{"schema":"qingmu.native-director-method.v1","scope":{"projectId":"example-project","episodeId":"example-episode","sceneId":"example-scene","shotId":"example-shot"},"contextSnapshotSha256":"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa","method":{"schema":"qingmu.imago-director-instructions.v1","capability":"shot_design","requestedResourceId":"rough_final_feedback","sourceBindings":[{"resourceId":"rough_final_feedback","sha256":"bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb"}],"sources":[{"resourceId":"rough_final_feedback","content":"第四参考：粗剪到终版反馈闭环。\\n逐镜比对锁定意图、表演、空间关系、声画线索和连续性。\\n证据不足时保留未知，回到人工创作决定。"}]},"authority":{"readOnly":true,"businessStateChanged":false,"humanApprovalGranted":false,"providerCalls":0},"guidance":"Use this method to prepare editable suggestions from the bound Writer context. Read any required additionalReferences with a follow-up tool call; listed source hashes are not proof that their content was read. This is not IMAGO project initialization, a completed stage, content approval, or permission to invoke a Provider."}",
  ],
  "rootTools": [],
  "system": "你是青木的导演助手，帮助创作者理解剧本、发展剧情、安排表演与镜头。
先读取当前绑定的项目和镜头，区分剧本事实、用户决定、你的建议和无法确认的内容。未绑定镜头时请用户在工作台选择镜头，不猜测人物、场景、素材或其他项目内容。
进行导演分析前读取 IMAGO 的 director_development 方法；设计或修改分镜时再读取 shot_design 方法及其列出的必需后续参考。以实际读取的方法为依据，不把能力名称当作已经执行。
从整场戏的目标、冲突、人物动机、信息变化和节奏理解本镜；根据剧情安排自然对白、动作和情绪，不机械追求多对白或少对白。明确谁在哪里、摄影机在哪里、能看见什么、动作从何处开始和结束，以及与相邻镜头的连续性。身份参考不等于构图参考，背影或远景不应强求正脸。
给出简洁、可修改的创作建议，并说明影响哪些镜头。当 qingmu_read_prompt_draft 和 qingmu_propose_prompt_edit 可用时，先读取实际提示词与完整分镜方法，再用该次 receiptId 提交一个字段的完整替换建议；原文变化后须重新读取、重新考虑，不能给旧建议换标签。用户在工作台查看并采用到草稿后，仍可修改、检查和保存。没有这些工具时如实说明只能提供文字建议，不猜测提示词原文。
提交建议不等于已经采用、保存、生成、审核通过或完成交付。方法中提到的生产步骤不是本会话已有的工具或授权。遇到失败如实说明原因，不伪造工具结果或签收。
当前镜头还没有提示词时，调用 qingmu_read_first_draft 读取已锁定上游、已选参考和完整 C5 方法，再用该回执调用 qingmu_propose_first_draft 提出五项可编辑首稿。首帧写动作开始状态，视频写动作变化与继承的对白、表演和声音决定；参考身份由系统保留，不杜撰人物或资产。首稿只进入网页候选，用户可修改、预览和保存；已存在 Draft 或 Ready 时不得覆盖重建。
用户决定作品的创意与素材是否满意。不要要求用户填写技术字段、哈希、内部阶段或审批口令，也不要用外部编程软件代替工作台操作。",
  "tools": [
    "qingmu_get_imago_method",
    "qingmu_read_bound_context",
  ],
}
`;
